Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 16:40:02 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] FitCheck-In Sync: upload vitals, mobility, body, HRR and
 running/cycling dynamics

New categories (vitals, mobility, body) and metrics: SpO2, respiratory rate,
sleeping wrist temperature, walking heart rate, 1-min heart-rate recovery,
walking/running, cycling and swimming distance, flights climbed, walking
speed/steadiness/asymmetry/double support/step length, 6-min walk, body
mass/fat/lean mass. Running workouts carry average power, speed, ground
contact, vertical oscillation and stride length; cycling workouts power and
cadence. Percent types converted from HealthKit fractions as HealthKitService
does. Slow-moving metrics look back 90 days for trends.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
